> Add a function parameter to perform the actual load/store to ram.
> With optimization, this results in identical code.
>=20
> Signed-off-by: Richard Henderson <richard.henderson@linaro.org>
> ---
>  accel/tcg/cputlb.c | 159 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
